# RISKS OF NOT PROCEEDING 

If the project is not approved:
 -Patient waiting times may continue increasing
 -Staff workload may increase
 -Operational costs may rise
 -Patient satisfaction may decline
 -NHS performance targets may not be achieved



# RECOMMENDATION TO PROJECT BOARD
Based on the analysis of current challenges, available options, expected benefits, and organisational objectives, implementation of a digital patient flow transformation programme is recommended.
The proposed solution provides the greatest opportunity to improve patient outcomes, operational efficiency, and long-term sustainability.


